1️⃣ Why Outbox Pattern?
❌ Problem in your current system

In Transaction Service:

1. Save transaction in DB
2. Publish event to Kafka

What if:

DB saved ✅
Kafka publish ❌ (failure)

👉 Now system is inconsistent:

Money transferred

But no notification / audit event

This is VERY dangerous in banking systems.

2️⃣ What is Outbox Pattern?

Instead of directly publishing to Kafka:

Save Transaction
Save Event in Outbox Table

Then a separate process:

Read Outbox Table → Publish to Kafka → Mark as Sent
