7️⃣ Benefits (Very Important)
✅ Guaranteed Delivery

Even if Kafka is down → event is stored

✅ Data Consistency

Transaction + Event always in sync

✅ Retry Mechanism

Failed events can be retried

✅ Decoupled Architecture

Publisher and DB logic separated

